              "value": "Clothing of Afghanistan|PD US|Robert Carrick|Author died more than 100 years ago public domain images|James Rattray|Women of Afghanistan in art|CC-PD-Mark|19th-century paintings of sitting women at full length|History of Afghanistan in art|PD-old missing SDC copyright status|PD-US missing SDC copyright status|Hookahs in art|Women of Kandahar in the 19th century",
